# config/eg4_6000xp_registers.yaml and config/config.example.yaml ARE meant
# to ship in the image (see Dockerfile) -- no exclusion needed for either;
# neither holds secrets. config.yaml (the old hand-edited live config) no
# longer exists as a concept -- device/site config is now runtime state on
# a volume (see app/devconfig.py), never baked into an image -- but this
# stays as a guard in case one is ever created by hand again.
config/config.yaml
*.env
.env

